  "cap": " height is $\\operatorname{Im} H_t$ and the colour $\\arg H_t$ (bar); $H_t$ is drawn on 2 surfaces, one for each sheet of $F$. Each deformed root or power $z^{\\alpha}$ runs along $z^{\\sigma}e^{2\\pi ik\\sigma}$, $\\sigma=1+(\\alpha-1)t$, where $k$ is its branch number on that surface. Shown at $t=1.00$, where $H_t=f_{2}\\circ G_t$ deforms $f_{2}$ ($t=0$) into $F(z)=\\sin\\left(\\sqrt{z}\\right)$ ($t=1$); it is the homotopy $H_t=f_{2}\\circ G_t$, $0\\le t\\le 1$, where $G_t$ is the homotopy $G_t(z)=z^{1-(1/2)t}$ (on every sheet). Here $F=f_{2}\\circ f_{1}$ with $f_{1}(z)=\\sqrt{z}$ and $f_{2}(w)=\\sin w$. On its natural domain $D=\\{z : \\arg z\\neq 180^\\circ\\}$, $F$ is analytic; this is guaranteed by the chain."
 },
